{"code":"000225","name":"유유제약1우","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"제약","sector_desc":"의약품을 개발·생산·판매. 신약 파이프라인과 임상 결과, 약가 정책에 주가가 크게 반응합니다.","desc":"동사는 1941년 유한무역주식회사로 설립되어 의약품 및 건강기능식품을 제조·판매하고 있으며, 충북 제천에 제조공장이 있음. 종속기업으로 유유헬스케어, 유유메디컬스, YUYU VENTURES, YUYU BIO, MERVYNS PETCARE를 두고 있음. 다양한 전문의약품을 국내 병의원에 공급하고, 의약품 수탁사업과 동남아시아 및 남미에 완제의약품을 수출하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-21","n_days":300,"close":3590.0,"open":3560.0,"high":3615.0,"low":3415.0,"volume":39678,"amount":142444020.0,"ret_1d":-0.4161,"gap":-1.2483,"range_pct":5.571,"ret_5":0.4196,"ret_20":-2.4457,"ret_60":-0.2778,"ret_120":-18.5941,"ret_250":-26.5097,"ma20":3607.0,"ma60":3667.1667,"ma120":3812.875,"ma200":4153.75,"close_vs_ma200":-13.5721,"close_vs_ma60":-2.1043,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-16.3493,"r2_60":0.495,"slope_120":-32.0144,"r2_120":0.5846,"slope_250":-32.2142,"r2_250":0.8389,"high52":5700.0,"low52":3345.0,"pos_52w":10.4034,"dd_52w":-37.0175,"mdd_1y":-35.7143,"atr14_pct":4.5364,"vol_ann_60":21.2958,"vol_avg20":8849.05,"vol_ratio20":4.4839,"vr5":1.2495,"vr20":0.3286,"amount_avg5":48834380.0,"amount_avg20":31596306.5,"amount_avg60":42186461.25,"obv_chg20":-30.5106,"turnover_20":7.8071,"pv_eff_20":-0.3133,"rsi14":46.7109,"frgn_net_5":892.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0393,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0393,"frgn_net_20":-3422.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.151,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.151,"frgn_net_60":-18765.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.8278,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.8278,"frgn_net_120":1435.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0633,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0633,"foreign_ratio":1.21,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.72,"smart_buy_streak":1,"op_income_q":40.0,"op_margin_q":10.8992,"op_qoq":-6.9767,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":81.8182,"rev_yoy":2.514,"op_trend_4q":4.1791,"fin_period":"202606","roe":9.66,"debt_ratio":42.21,"per":5.62,"pbr":0.45,"div_yield":3.48,"foreign_rate":1.16,"target_pri